  {
   "e": "🎒",
   "h": "«У мене є» — have got",
   "html": "<table class=\"t\"><tr><td>I / you / we / they</td><td><b>have got</b></td><td class=\"muted\">I've got</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>he / she / it</td><td><b>has got</b></td><td class=\"muted\">she's got</td></tr></table>\n        <div class=\"ex\"><div><div class=\"en\">I <b>have got</b> a dog. My sister <b>has got</b> a cat.</div><div class=\"ua\">У мене є собака. У сестри є кіт.</div></div><button class=\"say round\" data-say=\"I have got a dog. My sister has got a cat.\">🔊</button></div>\n        <div class=\"tip\">💡 Українською «у мене є», а англійською дослівно «я маю».</div>"
  },
  {
   "e": "🙅",
   "h": "«Немає»: haven't got / hasn't got",
   "html": "<div class=\"ex\"><div><div class=\"en\">We <b>haven't got</b> a car. He <b>hasn't got</b> a phone.</div><div class=\"ua\">У нас немає машини. У нього немає телефону.</div></div><button class=\"say round\" data-say=\"We haven't got a car. He hasn't got a phone.\">🔊</button></div>\n        <div class=\"tip\">⚠️ <s>I don't have got</s> — так не кажуть.</div>"
  },
  {
   "e": "❓",
   "h": "Питання: Have / Has … got?",
   "html": "<div class=\"ex\"><div><div class=\"en\"><b>Have</b> you <b>got</b> a pet? — Yes, I <b>have</b>.</div><div class=\"ua\">У тебе є домашня тварина? — Так.</div></div><button class=\"say round\" data-say=\"Have you got a pet? Yes, I have.\">🔊</button></div>\n        <div class=\"ex\"><div><div class=\"en\"><b>Has</b> your dad <b>got</b> a car? — No, he <b>hasn't</b>.</div><div class=\"ua\">У твого тата є машина? — Ні.</div></div><button class=\"say round\" data-say=\"Has your dad got a car? No, he hasn't.\">🔊</button></div>"
  }
 ],
